<title>USA: U.S. stock index futures up slightly, trade quiet.</title>
<headline>U.S. stock index futures up slightly, trade quiet.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 11 - U.S. stock index futures were up slightly in quiet trade. Sept S&amp;Ps waffle on both sides of Thurs close. Volume estimated at 19,000 so far. Several traders said buy-the-dips mentality continues. They said trade lakcluster now, but watch for a move later in the day.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312) 408-8750))</p>
